{"blocks": [{"polygon": [[73.048, 74.08500000000001], [155.624, 74.08500000000001], [155.624, 116.74], [73.048, 116.74]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "PageHeader", "raw_label": "Page-Header", "reading_order": 0, "html": "गणित", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [73.048, 74.08500000000001, 155.624, 116.74]}, {"polygon": [[752.712, 76.33000000000001], [820.996, 76.33000000000001], [820.996, 118.985], [752.712, 118.985]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "PageHeader", "raw_label": "Page-Header", "reading_order": 1, "html": "२२४", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [752.712, 76.33000000000001, 820.996, 118.985]}, {"polygon": [[1173.532, 74.08500000000001], [1514.952, 74.08500000000001], [1514.952, 118.985], [1173.532, 118.985]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "PageHeader", "raw_label": "Page-Header", "reading_order": 2, "html": "II गणित विषयक प्रक्रियाएँ", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [1173.532, 74.08500000000001, 1514.952, 118.985]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 145.925], [762.24, 145.925], [762.24, 417.57], [106.396, 417.57]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 3, "html": "<p>एक ही हार होता है। यथा <math>(\\frac{५}{६} + \\frac{३}{३} + \\frac{३}{४}) = (\\frac{६}{७} + \\frac{१}{७} + \\frac{५}{७} + \\frac{१}{७} + \\frac{५}{७} + \\frac{१}{७} + \\frac{५}{७} + \\frac{१}{७} + \\frac{५}{७} + \\frac{१}{७} + \\frac{५}{७} + \\frac{१}{७} + \\frac{५}{७} + \\frac{१}{७} + \\frac{5}{10} + \\frac{9}{10} + \\frac{13}{10} + \\frac{17}{10} + \\frac{21}{10} + \\frac{25}{10} + \\frac{29}{10} + &lt;|374|&gt;)</math><br/>इस प्रकार सर्व राशियोंके हारोंको समान करना समच्छेद कहलाता है) अब संकलन करना होइ तो परस्पर अंशनिकौ जोड़ दीजिए और व्यकलन करना होइ मूल राशिके अंशनिविषै ऋणशिके अंश घटाइ दीजिए। अर हार सबनिके समान भए। ताते हार परस्पर गुणे जेते भए तेते ही राखिए। ऐसे समान हार होनेतै याका नाम समच्छेद विघ्नान है। उदाहरणार्थ —</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 145.925, 762.24, 417.57]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 424.305], [740.008, 424.305], [740.008, 576.965], [106.396, 576.965]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 4, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\frac{५}{६} + \\frac{२}{३} + \\frac{३}{४} = \\frac{६}{७} + \\frac{४}{७} + \\frac{५}{७} + \\frac{४}{७} = \\frac{६० + ४५ + ४४}{७} = \\frac{१६२}{७}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 424.305, 740.008, 576.965]}, {"polygon": [[117.512, 583.7], [757.476, 583.7], [757.476, 734.115], [117.512, 734.115]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 5, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\text{अथवा } \\frac{५}{६} + \\frac{२}{३} = -\\frac{३}{४} = \\frac{६}{७} + \\frac{४}{७} - \\frac{५}{७} + \\frac{४}{७} = \\frac{६० + ४५ - ४४}{७} = \\frac{५४}{७}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [117.512, 583.7, 757.476, 734.115]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 740.85], [757.476, 740.85], [757.476, 855.345], [106.396, 855.345]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 6, "html": "<p>कोई सम्भवतः प्रमाणका भाग देइ भाज्य व भाजक (अंश व हार) राशिका महत्व प्रमाणकौ धोरा कीजिए वा निःशेष कीजिए तहाँ <u>अपवर्तन</u> संज्ञा जाननी।</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 740.85, 757.476, 855.345]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 866.57], [639.964, 866.57], [639.964, 940.655], [106.396, 940.655]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 7, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\text{यथा } = \\frac{१६२}{७} = \\frac{१८}{२} = \\frac{१}{२} \\text{ अथवा } \\frac{५४}{७} = \\frac{३}{४}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 866.57, 639.964, 940.655]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 947.39], [757.476, 947.39], [757.476, 1032.7], [106.396, 1032.7]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 8, "html": "<p>गुणकार विषै गुण्य और गुणकारके अंशको अंशकरि और हारको हारकरि गुणन करना। यथा <math>\\frac{५}{६} \\times \\frac{३}{३} \\times \\frac{३}{४} = \\frac{३}{७} = \\frac{९}{७}</math>।</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 947.39, 757.476, 1032.7]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 1039.435], [757.476, 1039.435], [757.476, 1156.175], [106.396, 1156.175]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 9, "html": "<p><b>मागहार</b> विषै भाजकके अंशको हार कीजिए और हस्तनिको अंश कीजिये। ऐस पलटि भाज्य भाजकका गुण्य गुणकारवत् (उपरोक्त) विधान करना।</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 1039.435, 757.476, 1156.175]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 1160.665], [757.476, 1160.665], [757.476, 1272.915], [106.396, 1272.915]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 10, "html": "<p>वर्ग और घनका विधान गुणकारवत् ही जानना। अर्थात् अंशों व हारोंका पृथक्-पृथक् वर्ग व घन करके अंशके वर्ग या घनको लग्धका अंश और हारके वर्ग या घनको लग्धका हार जानना।</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 1160.665, 757.476, 1272.915]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 1284.1399999999999], [703.484, 1284.1399999999999], [703.484, 1373.94], [106.396, 1373.94]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 11, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\text{यथा } \\left(\\frac{५}{६}\\right)^2 = \\frac{५}{६} = \\frac{२}{३} \\text{ अथवा } \\left(\\frac{५}{६}\\right)^3 = \\frac{५}{६} = \\frac{१२}{१६}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 1284.1399999999999, 703.484, 1373.94]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 1382.92], [757.476, 1382.92], [757.476, 1495.17], [106.396, 1495.17]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 12, "html": "<p>वर्गमूल व घनमूल का विधान भी वर्ग व घनवत् जानना। अंशका वर्ग या घन तो लग्धका अंश है और हारका वर्ग या घन लग्धका हार है।</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 1382.92, 757.476, 1495.17]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 1506.395], [782.884, 1506.395], [782.884, 1627.625], [106.396, 1627.625]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 13, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\text{यथा } \\left(\\frac{२}{३}\\right)^9 = \\frac{२}{३} = \\frac{५}{६} \\text{ अथवा } \\left(\\frac{१}{२}\\right)^3 = \\frac{१}{२} = \\frac{५}{१} = \\frac{५}{१} = \\frac{५}{१} = \\frac{५}{१} = \\frac{५}{१} = \\frac{५}{१} = \\frac{5}{10} + \\frac{9}{10} + \\frac{13}{10} + \\frac{17}{10} + \\frac{21}{10} + \\frac{25}{10} + \\frac{29}{10} + &lt;|374|&gt;)</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 1506.395, 782.884, 1627.625]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 1638.85], [530.392, 1638.85], [530.392, 1683.75], [106.396, 1683.75]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 14, "html": "<p>भिन्न परिक्रमांष्टक विषयक अनेकों प्रक्रियाएँ</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 1638.85, 530.392, 1683.75]}, {"polygon": [[73.048, 1690.485], [528.804, 1690.485], [528.804, 1730.895], [73.048, 1730.895]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 15, "html": "<p>भ.३/१,२,५/गा.२४-३२/४६ तथा (ध.५/प्र.११)—</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [73.048, 1690.485, 528.804, 1730.895]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 1742.1200000000001], [433.52400000000006, 1742.1200000000001], [433.52400000000006, 1825.185], [106.396, 1825.185]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 16, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(१) \\frac{न^2}{न+(न/प)} = न+ \\frac{न}{प+१}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 1742.1200000000001, 433.52400000000006, 1825.185]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 1840.8999999999999], [495.456, 1840.8999999999999], [495.456, 1906.0049999999999], [106.396, 1906.0049999999999]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 17, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(२) \\text{ यदि } \\frac{म}{द} = \\text{क और } \\frac{म}{द'} = \\text{क'}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 1840.8999999999999, 495.456, 1906.0049999999999]}, {"polygon": [[161.976, 1910.495], [639.964, 1910.495], [639.964, 1982.335], [161.976, 1982.335]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 18, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\text{तो } \\frac{म}{द+द'} = \\frac{\\text{क}}{१+(\\text{क} \\div \\text{क})} \\text{ या } \\frac{\\text{क'}}{(\\text{क} \\div \\text{क})+१}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [161.976, 1910.495, 639.964, 1982.335]}, {"polygon": [[106.396, 1995.805], [473.224, 1995.805], [473.224, 2101.32], [106.396, 2101.32]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 19, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(३) \\text{ यदि } \\frac{म}{द} = \\text{क और } \\frac{म'}{द} = \\text{क} \\\\ \\text{तो } (\\text{क} - \\text{क'}) + \\text{म'} = \\text{म}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [106.396, 1995.805, 473.224, 2101.32]}, {"polygon": [[836.8760000000001, 168.375], [1329.156, 168.375], [1329.156, 260.42], [836.8760000000001, 260.42]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 20, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(४) \\text{ यदि } \\frac{अ}{न} = \\text{क, तो } \\frac{अ}{न+\\frac{न}{न}} = \\text{क} - \\frac{\\text{क}}{न+१}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [836.8760000000001, 168.375, 1329.156, 260.42]}, {"polygon": [[886.104, 285.115], [1195.764, 285.115], [1195.764, 374.915], [886.104, 374.915]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 21, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\text{और } \\frac{अ}{न-\\frac{न}{न}} = \\text{क} + \\frac{\\text{क}}{न-१}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [886.104, 285.115, 1195.764, 374.915]}, {"polygon": [[836.8760000000001, 399.60999999999996], [1384.736, 399.60999999999996], [1384.736, 493.9], [836.8760000000001, 493.9]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 22, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(५) \\text{ यदि } \\frac{अ}{न} = \\text{क तो } \\frac{अ}{न+स} = \\text{क} - \\frac{\\text{क}}{न+१} \\text{ और}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [836.8760000000001, 399.60999999999996, 1384.736, 493.9]}, {"polygon": [[878.1640000000001, 514.105], [1138.596, 514.105], [1138.596, 603.9050000000001], [878.1640000000001, 603.9050000000001]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 23, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\frac{अ}{न-स} = \\text{क} + \\frac{\\text{क}}{न-१}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [878.1640000000001, 514.105, 1138.596, 603.9050000000001]}, {"polygon": [[836.8760000000001, 626.355], [1286.28, 626.355], [1286.28, 689.215], [836.8760000000001, 689.215]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 24, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(६) \\text{ यदि } \\frac{अ}{न} = \\text{क और } \\frac{अ}{न'} = \\text{क}+स, \\text{ तो}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [836.8760000000001, 626.355, 1286.28, 689.215]}, {"polygon": [[882.9280000000001, 729.625], [1076.664, 729.625], [1076.664, 821.67], [882.9280000000001, 821.67]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 25, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\frac{न'}{न} = \\frac{न}{क} + १</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [882.9280000000001, 729.625, 1076.664, 821.67]}, {"polygon": [[886.104, 844.12], [1313.2759999999998, 844.12], [1313.2759999999998, 936.165], [886.104, 936.165]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 26, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\text{यदि } \\frac{अ}{न} = \\text{क} - \\text{स, तो } \\frac{न'}{न} = \\frac{न}{क} + \\frac{\\text{क}}{स} - १</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [886.104, 844.12, 1313.2759999999998, 936.165]}, {"polygon": [[836.8760000000001, 960.86], [1351.388, 960.86], [1351.388, 1019.23], [836.8760000000001, 1019.23]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 27, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(७) \\text{ यदि } \\frac{अ}{न} - \\text{क और } \\frac{अ}{न'} \\text{ दूसरा भिन्न है, तो}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [836.8760000000001, 960.86, 1351.388, 1019.23]}, {"polygon": [[882.9280000000001, 1041.68], [1211.644, 1041.68], [1211.644, 1109.03], [882.9280000000001, 1109.03]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 28, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\frac{अ}{न} - \\frac{अ}{न'} = \\text{क} \\left[ \\frac{न'}{न'} - \\frac{न}{न'} \\right]</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [882.9280000000001, 1041.68, 1211.644, 1109.03]}, {"polygon": [[836.8760000000001, 1122.5], [1343.4479999999999, 1122.5], [1343.4479999999999, 1248.22], [836.8760000000001, 1248.22]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 29, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(८) \\text{ यदि } \\frac{अ}{न} = \\text{क और } \\frac{अ}{न-न} = \\text{क}+स, \\text{ तो} \\\\ \\text{ख} = \\frac{न \\text{स}}{क-स}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [836.8760000000001, 1122.5, 1343.4479999999999, 1248.22]}, {"polygon": [[836.8760000000001, 1257.2], [1324.392, 1257.2], [1324.392, 1385.165], [836.8760000000001, 1385.165]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 30, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(९) \\text{ यदि } \\frac{अ}{न} = \\text{क और } \\frac{अ}{न-ख} = \\text{क}+स, \\text{ तो} \\\\ \\text{ख} = \\frac{न \\text{स}}{क+स}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [836.8760000000001, 1257.2, 1324.392, 1385.165]}, {"polygon": [[836.8760000000001, 1394.145], [1337.096, 1394.145], [1337.096, 1517.6200000000001], [836.8760000000001, 1517.6200000000001]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 31, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(१०) \\text{ यदि } \\frac{अ}{न} = \\text{क और } \\frac{अ}{न+स} = \\text{क'}, \\text{ तो} \\\\ \\text{क'} = \\text{क} - \\frac{\\text{क स}}{न+स}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [836.8760000000001, 1394.145, 1337.096, 1517.6200000000001]}, {"polygon": [[836.8760000000001, 1528.845], [1321.216, 1528.845], [1321.216, 1654.565], [836.8760000000001, 1654.565]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 32, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(११) \\text{ यदि } \\frac{अ}{न} = \\text{क और } \\frac{अ}{न-स} = \\text{क'}, \\text{ तो} \\\\ \\text{क'} = \\text{क} + \\frac{\\text{क स}}{न-स}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [836.8760000000001, 1528.845, 1321.216, 1654.565]}, {"polygon": [[836.8760000000001, 1668.035], [1265.636, 1668.035], [1265.636, 1715.18], [836.8760000000001, 1715.18]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "SectionHeader", "raw_label": "Section-Header", "reading_order": 33, "html": "<h2>११. शून्य परिक्रमांष्टककी प्रक्रियाएँ</h2>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [836.8760000000001, 1668.035, 1265.636, 1715.18]}, {"polygon": [[809.88, 1712.935], [1508.6, 1712.935], [1508.6, 1829.675], [809.88, 1829.675]], "confidence": 0.9666975694289225, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 34, "html": "<p>गो. जी/पूर्व परिचय/६५/१७ अब शून्य परिक्रमांष्टक लिखिए हैं। शून्य नाम बिन्दीका है। ताके संकलनादिक (पूर्वोक्त आठों) कहिए हैं। तहाँ—</p>", "skipped": false, "error"